 admin:{title:'A collection in rehearsal',artist:'Administrator / unsigned draft',meta:'Third floor · private office',text:'The lower collection opens as a working exhibit. Nothing has been hung because nothing has been accepted.\n\nLot 409: twelve objects, six paired references. Damage is a history, not a conviction. A convincing likeness can be an accusation.\n\nSouth service remains available for inspection staff. The freight route requires curatorial clearance.'},
 timeEntrance:{title:'IV / In Perpetuity',artist:'Studies in recurrence and residue',meta:'Upper west collection · sequence / elapsed time',text:'The hand is always late. The trace is what has already happened. Begin where red divides the circle; count only the vacant rooms before ivory, clockwise.\n\nThree witnesses preserve three delays. Admit them in the order in which they hang. The small proof remembers their total.\n\nBeyond them, a machine remembers five beats. Four pass lightly; the fifth carries the weight. A familiar rhythm may return wearing an older face.'},
 timeTrace:{title:'Three Delays',artist:'Celia Orr, 2024',meta:'Three circular traces · red seam / ivory hand',text:'No clock tells the present.\n\nCount the empty sectors already crossed. Do not count the sector occupied by the hand. Read the three witnesses from left to right.'},
 timeProof:{title:'Eight Rooms Ago',artist:'Celia Orr, 2024',meta:'Eight erased sectors, three witnesses',text:'Together the delays have passed eight empty rooms. The first owes the second two; the third owes the first one.\n\nThis is the same account written without circles.'},
 fifthBeat:{title:'The Fifth Beat',artist:'Celia Orr, 2024',meta:'P/5 kinetic mechanism · metal, air, five pulses',text:'Four light footfalls. One heavier arrival.\n\nThe motor bears P/5 — 2024. Its accent survives every housing. Listen here; remember elsewhere.\n\nThe drum opens an archive when the three delays agree.'},
 afterimage:{title:'A borrowed face',artist:'Celia Orr, 2024',meta:'Movement drawing / afterimage archive',text:'A movement survives the case that conceals it.\n\nP/5 workshop stock was transferred downstairs under a restoration label. No replacement mechanism is authorised in Lot 409.\n\nThe signature remains four light beats and one low beat.'},
 quarantine:{title:'V / The Uncatalogued',artist:'Curatorial quarantine · Lot 409',meta:'Working exhibit / comparison and provenance',text:'Twelve arrivals wait beneath six paired references. A likeness records a moment; the accompanying history records what happened next.\n\nIn this lot, the Huntsman image and the woven face are reversed. Read the dagger from its marked FRONT. A seal meets its impression face to face.\n\nNo unrecorded replacement is permitted. Cross off the forgeries on the manifest. Feed the sheet to the verifier. Its three gauges answer for tables A, B and C, never for an individual object. South service remains your way back.'},
